  <h2>Technology</h2>
  <p>HyperGrad Image is built with Astro (SSG), React, and TypeScript. The website is statically generated and hosted on GitHub Pages, which means even our website infrastructure is simple and transparent—no complex server backend, no databases, no data collection pipelines.</p>
